      *================================================================*
      * PROGRAM  : UTCUTOFF                                            *
      * TYPE     : UNIT TEST DRIVER                                    *
      * PURPOSE  : UNIT TESTS FOR CUTOFF (VALUE / SETTLEMENT DATES)    *
      *            BUSINESS DATE 2026-09-30 (WED), NEXT 2026-10-01     *
      *================================================================*
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. UTCUTOFF.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY TESTPARM.
       COPY CUTPARM.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           MOVE 'INIT' TO TST-FUNCTION
           MOVE 'CUTOFF' TO TST-SUITE-NAME
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS

           PERFORM 1000-TEST-ACH
           PERFORM 1100-TEST-SDACH
           PERFORM 1200-TEST-WIRES
           PERFORM 1300-TEST-BOOK-AND-CALENDAR

           MOVE 'SUMM' TO TST-FUNCTION
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS
           STOP RUN.

       1000-TEST-ACH.
           MOVE 'A' TO CUT-PAY-TYPE
           MOVE 1500 TO CUT-REQUEST-TIME
           MOVE 5000.00 TO CUT-AMOUNT
           PERFORM 8000-CALL
           MOVE 'ACH BEFORE 16:00 PROCESSES TODAY' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 20260930 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE CUT-PROCESS-DATE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ
           MOVE 'ACH SETTLES NEXT BUSINESS DAY' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 20261001 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE CUT-SETTLE-DATE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

           MOVE 'A' TO CUT-PAY-TYPE
           MOVE 1600 TO CUT-REQUEST-TIME
           PERFORM 8000-CALL
           MOVE 'ACH AT EXACTLY 16:00 STILL MAKES CUTOFF'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 20260930 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE CUT-PROCESS-DATE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

           MOVE 'A' TO CUT-PAY-TYPE
           MOVE 1601 TO CUT-REQUEST-TIME
           PERFORM 8000-CALL
           MOVE 'ACH AFTER CUTOFF ROLLS TO NEXT BUSINESS DAY'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 20261001 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE CUT-PROCESS-DATE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ
           MOVE 'ACH AFTER CUTOFF SETTLES +1 FROM NEW DATE'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 20261002 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE CUT-SETTLE-DATE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ
           MOVE 'ACH AFTER CUTOFF RC 04 REASON PCUT' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'PCUT' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE CUT-REASON-CODE TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ.

       1100-TEST-SDACH.
           MOVE 'S' TO CUT-PAY-TYPE
           MOVE 1400 TO CUT-REQUEST-TIME
           MOVE 250000.00 TO CUT-AMOUNT
           PERFORM 8000-CALL
           MOVE 'SDACH BEFORE 14:30 SETTLES SAME DAY' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 20260930 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE CUT-SETTLE-DATE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

           MOVE 'S' TO CUT-PAY-TYPE
           MOVE 1400 TO CUT-REQUEST-TIME
           MOVE 1000000.00 TO CUT-AMOUNT
           PERFORM 8000-CALL
           MOVE 'SDACH EXACTLY 1,000,000 STAYS SAME DAY'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'S' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE CUT-EFFECTIVE-TYPE TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ

           MOVE 'S' TO CUT-PAY-TYPE
           MOVE 1400 TO CUT-REQUEST-TIME
           MOVE 1000000.01 TO CUT-AMOUNT
           PERFORM 8000-CALL
           MOVE 'SDACH OVER 1MM DOWNGRADES TO ACH' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'A' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE CUT-EFFECTIVE-TYPE TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ
           MOVE 'SDACH OVER 1MM REASON SDLM' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'SDLM' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE CUT-REASON-CODE TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ

           MOVE 'S' TO CUT-PAY-TYPE
           MOVE 1500 TO CUT-REQUEST-TIME
           MOVE 900.00 TO CUT-AMOUNT
           PERFORM 8000-CALL
           MOVE 'SDACH AFTER 14:30 BECOMES STANDARD ACH TODAY'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 20261001 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE CUT-SETTLE-DATE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ
           MOVE 'SDACH AFTER CUTOFF REASON SDCT' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'SDCT' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE CUT-REASON-CODE TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ.

       1200-TEST-WIRES.
           MOVE 'W' TO CUT-PAY-TYPE
           MOVE 1745 TO CUT-REQUEST-TIME
           MOVE 85000.00 TO CUT-AMOUNT
           PERFORM 8000-CALL
           MOVE 'WIRE AT 17:45 SAME DAY' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 20260930 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE CUT-SETTLE-DATE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

           MOVE 'W' TO CUT-PAY-TYPE
           MOVE 1750 TO CUT-REQUEST-TIME
           PERFORM 8000-CALL
           MOVE 'WIRE AFTER 17:45 NEXT BUSINESS DAY' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 20261001 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE CUT-PROCESS-DATE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

           MOVE 'I' TO CUT-PAY-TYPE
           MOVE 1420 TO CUT-REQUEST-TIME
           PERFORM 8000-CALL
           MOVE 'INTL WIRE BEFORE 15:00 SETTLES T+2' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 20261002 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE CUT-SETTLE-DATE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

           MOVE 'I' TO CUT-PAY-TYPE
           MOVE 1605 TO CUT-REQUEST-TIME
           PERFORM 8000-CALL
           MOVE 'INTL WIRE AFTER 15:00 ROLLS, SETTLES MON 10-05'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 20261005 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE CUT-SETTLE-DATE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ.

       1300-TEST-BOOK-AND-CALENDAR.
           MOVE 'B' TO CUT-PAY-TYPE
           MOVE 2330 TO CUT-REQUEST-TIME
           MOVE 150.00 TO CUT-AMOUNT
           PERFORM 8000-CALL
           MOVE 'BOOK TRANSFER 23:30 STILL SAME DAY' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 20260930 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE CUT-PROCESS-DATE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

           INITIALIZE CUTOFF-PARMS
           MOVE 'W' TO CUT-PAY-TYPE
           MOVE 20261010 TO CUT-REQUEST-DATE
           MOVE 1800 TO CUT-REQUEST-TIME
           MOVE 20260930 TO CUT-BUSINESS-DATE
           CALL 'CUTOFF' USING CUTOFF-PARMS
           MOVE 'SATURDAY + COLUMBUS DAY ROLL TO TUE 10-13'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 20261013 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE CUT-PROCESS-DATE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ
           MOVE 'FUTURE DATE IGNORES TIME OF DAY - REASON NBDR'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'NBDR' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE CUT-REASON-CODE TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ

           INITIALIZE CUTOFF-PARMS
           MOVE 'A' TO CUT-PAY-TYPE
           MOVE 20260925 TO CUT-REQUEST-DATE
           MOVE 0900 TO CUT-REQUEST-TIME
           MOVE 20260930 TO CUT-BUSINESS-DATE
           CALL 'CUTOFF' USING CUTOFF-PARMS
           MOVE 'BACK-DATED REQUEST MOVES TO BUSINESS DATE'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 20260930 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE CUT-PROCESS-DATE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

           INITIALIZE CUTOFF-PARMS
           MOVE 'Z' TO CUT-PAY-TYPE
           MOVE 20260930 TO CUT-BUSINESS-DATE
           CALL 'CUTOFF' USING CUTOFF-PARMS
           MOVE 'INVALID PAY TYPE RC 12' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 12 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE CUT-RETURN-CODE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ.

      *    STANDARD CALL: TODAY, BANKCTL CUTOFFS 1600/1430/1745
       8000-CALL.
           MOVE 20260930 TO CUT-REQUEST-DATE CUT-BUSINESS-DATE
           MOVE 1600 TO CUT-ACH-CUTOFF
           MOVE 1430 TO CUT-SDACH-CUTOFF
           MOVE 1745 TO CUT-WIRE-CUTOFF
           MOVE 'C'  TO CUT-DR-CR
           CALL 'CUTOFF' USING CUTOFF-PARMS.

       9000-NEQ.
           MOVE 'NEQ' TO TST-FUNCTION
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS.

       9100-AEQ.
           MOVE 'AEQ' TO TST-FUNCTION
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS.
